{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to Cats Organized Neatly!</h2><br>So, you have decided to become a crazy cat person. <br>Or you just like cats? <br>If that\u2019s the case you are definitely at the right place! Because we have cats! 30 of them to be exact. They come in all shapes and sizes and\u2026 we\u2019ve kinda lost track of all of them. <br><br>If you could take some time and just help us organize the little ones. Just pick them up and place them on the grid over there. <br>And don\u2019t worry, they won\u2019t bite even if you rotate them a bit.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1369340/extras/425e27299134da4298e91046094adee9.poster.avif?t=1750324073\" width=600 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1369340/extras/425e27299134da4298e91046094adee9.webm?t=1750324073\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1369340/extras/425e27299134da4298e91046094adee9.mp4?t=1750324073\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> <strong>Cats</strong><br>30 unique hand drawn cats for you to befriend, collect and organize (neatly).<br></li><li> <strong>Handcrafted Levels</strong><br>The games come with 80 handcrafted levels which will hopefully tickle your brain.<br></li><li> <strong>Simple Controls</strong><br>The game can be played by just clicking the left and right mouse buttons, which makes it very accessible for newcomers or seasoned puzzlers of any age.<br></li><li> <strong>Relaxing Music</strong><br>Cats Organized Neatly has relaxing background music, resembling the atmosphere of a Cat Caf\u00e9. Sit down and pet some cats.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_ite